"""the session version never decreases (Keelstone)

Revision ID: k0009_session_version_grows
Revises: k0008_content_visibility
Create Date: 2026-11-25T00:00:00+00:00

The application login may raise users.token_epoch (a user's own password change), so a policy
cannot stop it from lowering the value again, which would bring back the sessions that were
ended. A trigger refuses every decrease (app/db/tenancy.py, NON_DECREASING_COLUMNS). Row level
security is applied again to users, which creates it.
"""

from alembic import op

from app.db.tenancy import POLICY_PREFIX, segregation_statements

